```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "I need to share the results from my quality-hold area inspection. I found that exactly 150 of the held modules can be recovered after a 6-hour controlled bake followed by insulation testing. I documented this in a local inspection worksheet, though I should note it has not yet been attached to the material record. So the approved recovery limit from quality-hold is 150 modules, not the 270 that would be needed to fulfill the complete plan."}
```

